MOTOR1 → Motor Driver Shield
● Red Wire → M1
● Black Wire → M1

MOTOR2 → Motor Driver Shield
● Red Wire → M4
● Black Wire → M4

Servo → Motor Driver Shield (Servo Header)
● Brown Wire → GND
● Red Wire → VCC
● Orange Wire → Signal

Ultrasonic Sensor (HC-SR04) → Motor Driver Shield
● VCC → +5V
● Trig → A0
● Echo → A1
● GND → GND

Battery (7.4-9V) → Motor Driver Shield
● Positive (Red) → Switch → +M
● Negative (Black) → GND
